#: ../../source/fast-glob_README.md:5
msgid ""
"This package provides methods for traversing the file system and "
"returning pathnames that matched a defined set of a specified pattern "
"according to the rules used by the Unix Bash shell with some "
"simplifications, meanwhile results are returned in **arbitrary order**. "
"Quick, simple, effective."
